      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PINDAAN KEPADA AKTA CUKAI PENDAPATAN 1967 Permulaan kuat kuasa pindaan kepada Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "III",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_23",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_24",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_25",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_26",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_27"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PINDAAN KEPADA AKTA CUKAI KEUNTUNGAN HARTA TANAH 1976 Permulaan kuat kuasa pindaan kepada Akta Cukai Keuntungan Harta Tanah 1976"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_23__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_23__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_23__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 24 dan 27 mula berkuat kuasa apabila berkuatkuasanya Akta ini."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_23__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 25 dan 26 disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 12 Oktober 2019. Pindaan seksyen 21b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Cukai Keuntungan Harta Tanah 1976, yang disebut “Akta ibu” dalam Bab ini, dipinda dalam subseksyen 21b(1A) dengan menggantikan perkataan “bukan warganegara dan bukan pemastautin tetap” dengan perkataan “bukan warganegara, bukan pemastautin tetap atau bukan suatu syarikat yang diperbadankan di Malaysia”. Pindaan Jadual 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jadual 2 kepada Akta ibu dipinda dalam perenggan 2A dengan menggantikan perkataan “1 Januari 2000” dengan perkataan “1 Januari 2013”. Pindaan Jadual 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jadual 3 kepada Akta ibu dipinda dalam subperenggan 13(2) dengan menggantikan perkataan “1 Januari 2000” di mana-mana jua terdapat dengan perkataan “1 Januari 2013”. Pindaan Jadual 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_27__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_27__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jadual 5 kepada Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_27__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam Bahagian II, dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “syarikat” perkataan “yang diperbadankan di Malaysia atau pemegang amanah bagi suatu amanah”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_27__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_III__cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam Bahagian III, dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “atau wasi bagi harta pusaka si mati yang bukan warganegara dan bukan juga pemastautin tetap” perkataan “, atau syarikat yang tidak diperbadankan di Malaysia”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 74(4) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “subsection 103(3), (4), (5), (6), (7) or (8)” dengan perkataan “subsection 103(3), (5) or (7)”. Pindaan seksyen 77b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 77 b Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan subseksyen (4) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(4) The tax or additional tax payable under subsection (1) shall be increased by a sum equal to ten per cent of the amount of such tax or additional tax.”. Pindaan seksyen 91"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 91 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (6) subseksyen yang berikut: “(7) Notwithstanding subsections (1) and (5), the Director General may at any time make an assessment or additional assessment, as the case may be, for a year of assessment in respect of a person, in the amount or additional amount of chargeable income and tax, in consequence of a mutual agreement procedure in the double taxation arrangement effected under section 132.”. Pindaan seksyen 96"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subperenggan 96(4)(c)(ii) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “subsection 103(5), (6), (7) or (8)” dengan perkataan “subsection 103(5) or (7)”. Pindaan seksyen 100"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 100 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(1) A person seeking to appeal against an assessment after the expiration of the period to make an appeal under subsection 99(1), may within seven years after the end of that period, make to the Director General a written application in the prescribed form for an extension of that period within which a notice of appeal against that assessment may be given under that subsection.”. Pindaan seksyen 103"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
