        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (3), (4), (5) dan (6), dengan menggantikan perkataan “Minister” dengan perkataan “Director General”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II__cl_19__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/msa@/~chp_II__cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (6) subseksyen yang berikut: “(6A) Any person aggrieved by the decision of the Director General in respect of— (a) refusal to grant a renewal of an approval; or (b) revocation of an approval, may, within one month from the date on which such decision is notified to him, make an appeal in writing to the Minister, whose decision shall be final.”. Pindaan Jadual 1"
