        "@value": "dalam perenggan (h), dengan menggantikan perkataan “infrastructure and information and communication technology” dengan perkataan “infrastructure, information and communication technology or maintenance of a building designated as a heritage site by the Commissioner of Heritage under the National Heritage Act 2005 [Act 645]”; dan"
